# Privacy Policy — PDF Magician

**Last updated:** March 17, 2026

## Overview

PDF Magician is an offline PDF management application. Your privacy is important to us. This policy explains how the app handles your data.

## Data Collection

**PDF Magician does not collect, transmit, or share any personal data.** The app operates entirely offline on your device.

## Data Storage

All data created or processed by the app is stored locally on your device:

- **PDF files** — Merged, edited, and created PDF files are saved to your device's local documents directory.
- **Notes** — Your notes and thoughts are stored as a local JSON file on your device. They are never uploaded or synced to any server.
- **Preferences** — App settings such as theme mode and language preference are saved locally using on-device storage.

## Permissions

PDF Magician requests the following device permissions:

| Permission | Purpose |
|---|---|
| **Storage / Files and Media** | To browse, select, and save PDF files on your device. |

These permissions are used solely to enable the app's core functionality. No files are accessed beyond those you explicitly select.

## File Access

The app requests access to your device's file system solely to:

- Pick PDF and image files you explicitly select.
- Save generated or modified PDF files to your device.

The app does not access any files beyond those you choose to open.

## Third-Party Services

PDF Magician does not integrate with any third-party analytics, advertising, or tracking services. No data is sent to external servers.

## Sharing

When you use the share feature, the app invokes your device's native share sheet. The app itself does not control or monitor what happens after you choose a sharing destination.

## Children's Privacy

The app does not knowingly collect any information from anyone, including children under the age of 13.

## Changes to This Policy

We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected by the "Last updated" date at the top of this document.

